# Closed tier. This repository is PUBLIC; .superpowers/closed-tier/ holds the
# commercial tier's substance -- the Postgres schema and RLS design, the
# hosted deployment topology, the control plane. Those documents live in the
# private memorysafe-cloud repository. Ignoring the path here is what stops
# `git add -A` in a worktree from republishing them, which is how
# 2026-09-05-postgres-backend.md reached origin/master in the first place.
.superpowers/closed-tier/
